itle=\"Sphere\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background-image: none; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;\"\u003esphere\u003c/a\u003e-shaped oliebol emerges. Oliebollen are traditionally eaten on\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_Year%27s_Eve\" title=\"New Year's Eve\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background-image: none; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;\"\u003eNew Year's Eve\u003c/a\u003e\u003csup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\" style=\"line-height: 1; unicode-bidi: -webkit-isolate; font-size: 11px;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oliebol#cite_note-1\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background-image: none; white-space: nowrap; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;\"\u003e[1]\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/sup\u003e\u0026nbsp;and at\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Funfair\" title=\"Funfair\" class=\"mw-redirect\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background-image: none; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;\"\u003efunfairs\u003c/a\u003e. In wintertime, they are also sold in the street at mobile stalls.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(37, 37, 37); font-family: sans-serif;\"\u003eThe dough is made from\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flour\" title=\"Flour\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background-image: none; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;\"\u003eflour\u003c/a\u003e,\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Egg_(food)\" title=\"Egg (food)\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background-image: none; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;\"\u003eeggs\u003c/a\u003e,\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yeast\" title=\"Yeast\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background-image: none; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;\"\u003eyeast\u003c/a\u003e, some\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Salt\" title=\"Salt\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background-image: none; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;\"\u003esalt\u003c/a\u003e,\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Milk\" title=\"Milk\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background-image: none; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;\"\u003emilk\u003c/a\u003e,\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baking_powder\" title=\"Baking powder\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background-image: none; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;\"\u003ebaking powder\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;and usually\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sultana_(grape)\" title=\"Sultana (grape)\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background-image: none; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;\"\u003esultanas\u003c/a\u003e,\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ribes\" title=\"Ribes\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background-image: none; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;\"\u003ecurrants\u003c/a\u003e,\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raisin\" title=\"Raisin\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background-image: none; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;\"\u003eraisins\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;and sometimes\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zest_(ingredient)\" title=